{"level":"debug","module":"llm","time":1749859311170,"caller":"/Users/amakura/source/repos/aiup-go-gen/internal/llm/open_ai_client.go:101","message":"OpenAI response: Wireframe: User Login Page (Angular Web App)\n\n-------------------------------------------------------------\n|                   Top Navigation Bar                      |\n|-----------------------------------------------------------|\n|   [Logo]        [Home]   [About]   [Help]                 |\n-------------------------------------------------------------\n\n|                                                           |\n|                     MAIN CONTENT AREA                     |\n|                                                           |\n|  +-----------------------------------------------------+  |\n|  |                                                     |  |\n|  |                Welcome Back!                        |  |\n|  |                                                     |  |\n|  |  [ Email Address:  ______________________ ]          |  |\n|  |                                                     |  |\n|  |  [ Password:      ______________________ ]           |  |\n|  |                                                     |  |\n|  |  [ ] Remember Me           [Forgot Password?]        |  |\n|  |                                                     |  |\n|  |              [ Login ]   (Primary CTA)              |  |\n|  |                                                     |  |\n|  |  ---------------- OR ----------------              |  |\n|  |                                                     |  |\n|  |  [Login with Google]   [Login with Microsoft]        |  |\n|  |                                                     |  |\n|  |  Don’t have an account? [Sign Up]                   |  |\n|  +-----------------------------------------------------+  |\n|                                                           |\n\n-------------------------------------------------------------\n|                       Footer (Fixed)                     |\n|-----------------------------------------------------------|\n|  © 2024 CompanyName | [Privacy Policy] [Contact Support]  |\n-------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSection Explanations:\n\n1. Top Navigation Bar:\n   - Static, minimal, with logo and optional links to Home, About, and Help.\n   - Purpose: Ensures brand presence, easy access to informational pages even before login.\n\n2. Main Content Area:\n   - Centered login form with clear fields for email and password.\n   - [Remember Me] checkbox for longer sessions.\n   - [Forgot Password?] link to recover credentials.\n   - [Login] button is the primary call to action (prominent, likely blue).\n   - Social login options for quick sign-in.\n   - Secondary access to registration if the user has no account (“Don’t have an account? Sign up”).\n   - Form is visually grouped for clarity and quick scanning.\n\n3. Footer (Fixed):\n   - Always visible at the bottom.\n   - Contains quick links: Privacy Policy, Contact Support, and a copyright.\n   - Purpose: Access to help or compliance at any stage.\n\nUser Interaction Flow:\n- User enters email/password and clicks [Login]. If credentials invalid, system shows error inline.\n- Option to use social logins.\n- Can access password recovery or sign up for new account.\n- Navigation and footer remain accessible on all screen sizes.\n\nThis wireframe ensures clarity, focus, and straightforward access, reducing user friction in login flows.\n\n→ Ready to send to the Assistant agent for implementing the Angular login page UI."}
