{"level":"debug","module":"llm","time":1749859979840,"caller":"/Users/amakura/source/repos/aiup-go-gen/internal/llm/open_ai_client.go:101","message":"OpenAI response: Text-Based Wireframe: User Login Page for Angular Web App\n\n--------------------- Top Navigation Bar ---------------------\n|           [Logo]          |         [Home]         |               [Help]               |               [Contact]              |\n\n------------------------- Main Content ------------------------\n\n              +------------------------------------------+\n              |                                          |\n              |               [App Name]                 |\n              |      Welcome! Please sign in below.      |\n              |                                          |\n              |  [ Email Address:            [_______] ] |\n              |                                          |\n              |  [ Password:                [_______] ]  |\n              |                                          |\n              |      [ Log In ] (Primary Button)         |\n              |                                          |\n              |   [ Forgot Password? ] [ Sign Up ]       |\n              |                                          |\n              +------------------------------------------+\n\n------------------------ Fixed Footer -------------------------\n| © 2024 Company Name | Privacy Policy | Terms of Service |\n\n---\n\nExplanation of Sections:\n\n1. Top Navigation Bar:\n   - Purpose: Consistent navigation throughout app even on login page.\n   - Elements:\n     - [Logo]: Returns to landing/welcome page.\n     - [Home]: Main site landing.\n     - [Help]: Link to help/contact resources (may open modal or go to FAQ).\n     - [Contact]: Link to support contact.\n\n2. Main Content Area:\n   - Purpose: Focused, minimal login form for all users.\n   - Elements:\n     - [App Name]: Branding.\n     - Welcome message: Friendly guidance for new/returning users.\n     - [Email Address] and [Password] fields: Clear labels and input boxes.\n     - [Log In]: Prominent, high-contrast CTA button.\n     - [Forgot Password?]: Link for recovery.\n     - [Sign Up]: Secondary link for new users.\n\n3. Fixed Footer:\n   - Purpose: Legal and support links, always available.\n   - Elements:\n     - Copyright.\n     - [Privacy Policy]: Short informative link.\n     - [Terms of Service]: Short informative link.\n\nInteraction/Navigation:\n- Users enter credentials then tap [Log In].\n- “Forgot Password?” opens recovery workflow.\n- “Sign Up” leads to registration page.\n- Top navigation elements allow leaving the login process for help or contact if needed.\n- Footer provides links to critical policy information.\n\nThis wireframe prioritizes clarity (clear input labels), strong affordances (button vs. links), and minimal distractions—per usability best practices for login experiences. \n\nRequesting Assistant agent to code this UI in Angular."}
