endly guidance for new/returning users.\n     - [Email Address] and [Password] fields: Clear labels and input boxes.\n     - [Log In]: Prominent, high-contrast CTA button.\n     - [Forgot Password?]: Link for recovery.\n     - [Sign Up]: Secondary link for new users.\n\n3. Fixed Footer:\n   - Purpose: Legal and support links, always available.\n   - Elements:\n     - Copyright.\n     - [Privacy Policy]: Short informative link.\n     - [Terms of Service]: Short informative link.\n\nInteraction/Navigation:\n- Users enter credentials then tap [Log In].\n- “Forgot Password?” opens recovery workflow.\n- “Sign Up” leads to registration page.\n- Top navigation elements allow leaving the login process for help or contact if needed.\n- Footer provides links to critical policy information.\n\nThis wireframe prioritizes clarity (clear input labels), strong affordances (button vs. links), and minimal distractions—per usability best practices for login experiences. \n\nRequesting Assistant agent to code this UI in Angular."}
