{"level":"debug","module":"llm","time":1749861108139,"caller":"/Users/amakura/source/repos/aiup-go-gen/internal/llm/open_ai_client.go:101","message":"OpenAI response: Text-Based Wireframe: Main User Login Page (Angular Web App)\n\n───────────────────────────────────────────────\n|    [Logo]                      [Help?]       |   ← Top Navigation Bar\n───────────────────────────────────────────────\n|                                             |\n|         Sign In to Your Account             |\n|                                             |\n|   [ Email Address ....................... ] |   ← Input Field (with label)\n|                                             |\n|   [ Password ............................ ] |   ← Input Field (with label)\n|                                             |\n|   [  ☐  Remember Me  ]         [Forgot?]    |   ← Checkbox & Password reset link\n|                                             |\n|   [          Log In          ]              |   ← Primary Action Button (highlighted)\n|                                             |\n|   ─────────────── or ───────────────         |\n|                                             |\n|   [ Log in with Google ]  [ Log in with ... ]| ← Optional social buttons\n|                                             |\n|   Don’t have an account? [Sign Up]          |   ← Link to registration\n|                                             |\n───────────────────────────────────────────────\n|         © 2024 [Product/Company Name]        |   ← Fixed Footer (small, centered)\n───────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nSection Explanations:\n1. Top Navigation Bar\n   - Contains company/product logo for quick recognition; typically not much navigation on a login screen, but \"Help\" or FAQ link may be present to aid users with login difficulties.\n2. Main Content Area\n   - Central heading (“Sign In to Your Account”) for user orientation.\n   - Email and Password input fields—clearly labeled with adequate spacing for clarity.\n   - Remember Me: Checkbox for persistent login (optional, improves convenience).\n   - Forgot Password: Link for credential recovery—visibly distinct and close to password field.\n   - Log In: Prominent CTA button, styled to invite interaction.\n   - Social Login Options: (Optional section) Clearly delimited and placed below primary CTA. Helps reduce friction for users who prefer SSO.\n   - Sign Up: For new users, a clear, non-distracting link to registration.\n3. Footer (Fixed)\n   - Contains copyright/disclaimer or quick company links.\n   - Fixed so always visible, reinforcing brand and compliance.\n\nUser Flow:\n- User enters email and password, may opt for \"Remember Me,\" and clicks \"Log In\" to proceed.\n- \"Forgot?\" directs to password recovery.\n- \"Sign Up\" goes to registration (new account creation).\n- Social login buttons can offer alternative login.\n- \"Help?\" gives troubleshooting or contact info.\n\nThis design delivers a focused, minimal login experience, reduces distractions, and ensures high clarity and discoverability for all login-related actions.\n\nReady for handoff to the development team for implementation in Angular."}
