{"level":"debug","module":"llm","time":1749861909065,"caller":"/Users/amakura/source/repos/aiup-go-gen/internal/llm/open_ai_client.go:101","message":"OpenAI response: Here is a text-based wireframe for a main user login page for your Angular web app.\n\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nTop Navigation Bar\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n|           [App Logo]        |   Home   |   Help   |   Contact   |\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nMain Content Area\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n|                                                            |\n|                [Welcome Back!]                             |\n|                [Please sign in to continue]                |\n|                                                            |\n|     ┌─────────────────────────────┐                        |\n|     |  Email Address            |  [                ]      |\n|     |---------------------------|                        |\n|     |  Password                 |  [                ]      |\n|     └─────────────────────────────┘                        |\n|                                                            |\n|     [ ] Remember me      [Forgot Password?]                |\n|                                                            |\n|     [🔑 Login]                                              |\n|                                                            |\n|     ───────────── or ─────────────                         |\n|                                                            |\n|     [Sign in with Google]   [Sign in with Facebook]         |\n|                                                            |\n|     ----------- New user? [Create Account] ------------    |\n|                                                            |\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nFooter (Fixed)\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n|    © 2024 YourAppName | Privacy Policy | Terms of Use      |\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nSection Explanations:\n\n1. Top Navigation Bar\n   - Characters: “Home,” “Help,” “Contact”.\n   - Purpose: Provides easy brand recognition (“App Logo”) and quick access to help/contact information before login.\n\n2. Main Content Area\n   - Central focus for user actions.\n   - Email & Password fields let users enter credentials.\n   - “Login” button is clearly labeled and prominent.\n   - “Remember me” and “Forgot Password?” support common login needs.\n   - Social login buttons are offered for convenience and speed.\n   - “Create Account” link for new users.\n   - Minimal distractions for direct task completion.\n\n3. Footer (Fixed)\n   - Essential legal or support links (Privacy, Terms).\n   - Always visible for trust and quick access.\n\nUser Flow:\n- Users land on the page and see clear sign-in/instruction text.\n- Users can enter their credentials, check \"Remember me,\" and click [Login].\n- Alternate sign-in options available (Google, Facebook).\n- Can navigate to help, contact, or create an account.\n- Footer links always accessible.\n\nThis wireframe prioritizes clarity, ease of use, and encourages users to complete the login process with minimal friction.\n\nPlease proceed to code up this screen for an Angular app."}
