{"level":"debug","module":"llm","time":1749941954148,"caller":"/Users/amakura/source/repos/aiup-go-gen/internal/llm/open_ai_client.go:101","message":"OpenAI response: Here is a text-based wireframe for a main user login page in an Angular web app, following the UX constraints and best practices mentioned:\n\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nTOP NAVIGATION BAR\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n|  [App Logo]         Login      |      Help      |    Settings   |\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nMAIN CONTENT (Centered on page)\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n|                                                            |\n|                USER LOGIN                                   |\n|                                                            |\n|   [ Email Address_________________________ ]                |\n|   [ Password _____________________________ ]                |\n|                                                            |\n|   [ Log In ]              [ Forgot Password? ]              |\n|                                                            |\n|   ————————— or —————————                                  |\n|   [ Log in with Google ]  [ Log in with GitHub ]           |\n|                                                            |\n|   Don't have an account? [ Sign Up ]                        |\n|                                                            |\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nFIXED FOOTER\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n|    © 2024 MyApp   |   Privacy Policy   |   Contact Us      |\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n---\n\nSection Explanations & User Interactions:\n\n1. TOP NAVIGATION BAR:\n   - Contains the application logo (which can be clicked to reload/return to