tment list in table/list format. Shows time, client, with Edit/Delete icons per row.\n   - Prominent “+ New Appointment” button for primary CTA.\n   - Action buttons (Edit, Delete) next to each appointment for quick management.\n\n4. Fixed Footer\n   - Persistent, includes quick links: help, privacy, contact, copyright.\n   - Provides support and legal access from any page.\n\nNavigation & Interactions:\n- Top nav enables jumping between application modules; left nav filters entities.\n- User sees immediate system status (upcoming/past appointments, quick summary).\n- Primary work focus and attention: main appointment list and booking (“+ New Appointment”).\n- All actions (create, edit, delete) clearly available with visuals (button, icon).\n- Users can quickly browse through weeks and filter appointment types.\n\nDelegating to coding agent for implementation."}
