023 | 2PM   | Checkup with B | Edit, Del|  | |\\n| | |                                               |  | |\\n| | ----------------------------------------------   | |\\n| | [< Previous Week]                    [Next Week >]| |\\n| +----------------------------------------------------+ |\\n+----------------------------------------------------------------+\\n|                    Fixed Footer                              |\\n| Quick Links | Contact Us | Privacy Policy                     |\\n+----------------------------------------------------------------+\\n```\\n\\nExplanation:\\n- **Top Navigation Bar**: This is the primary way to navigate the site. Includes links to 'Home/Dashboard', 'Appointments', 'Search', and 'Settings'.\\n- **Dashboard Overview**: Displays current status of appointments, including total and upcoming counts. Includes a prominent \\\"+ New Appointment\\\" button for adding new entries.\\n- **Appointments List**: Displays a table with details for each appointment (Date, Time, Subject) and actions (Edit, Delete). Users can navigate between weeks using the 'Previous Week' and 'Next Week' links.\\n- **Fixed Footer**: Contains quick links for commonly needed actions or information (e.g., 'Contact Us', 'Privacy Policy').\\n\\nThis layout provides a clear, concise view of the application, allowing users to manage their appointments efficiently and easily navigate related options.\",\n  \"route_target\": \"assistant\"\n}"}
