{"level":"debug","agent":"ux","time":1750398761485,"caller":"/Users/amakura/source/repos/aiup-go-gen/internal/agent/assistant.go:210","message":"```\n+------------------------------------------------------+\n|                   Top Navigation Bar                  |\n|------------------------------------------------------|\n|                                                      |\n|              Logo      |      Home    |             |\n|------------------------------------------------------|\n|                                                      |\n|                                                      |\n|                                                      |\n|                   Login Page Main Area               |\n|                                                      |\n|          +----------------------------------+        |\n|          |                                  |        |\n|          |        [Login Form Title]        |        |\n|          |                                  |        |\n|          |  Username: [____________]        |        |\n|          |  Password: [____________]        |        |\n|          |                                  |        |\n|          |  [  Login Button  ]              |        |\n|          |  [ Forgot Password? ]            |        |\n|          +----------------------------------+        |\n|                                                      |\n|                                                      |\n|                                                      |\n+------------------------------------------------------+\n|                 Fixed Footer with Links              |\n|------------------------------------------------------|\n| Home | About | Contact | Privacy Policy              |\n+------------------------------------------------------+\n```\nExplanation:\n\n- **Top Navigation Bar:** This is a fixed horizontal navigation bar at the top of the page with a logo and key navigation points such as 'Home.'\n\