{"level":"debug","agent":"ux","time":1750398821800,"caller":"/Users/amakura/source/repos/aiup-go-gen/internal/agent/assistant.go:210","message":"Here is a simple wireframe for the main login page of a new Angular web app:\n\n----------------------------------------\n| Top Navigation Bar                   |\n|  (e.g., logo or web app name)        |\n----------------------------------------\n|\n|              Login                   |\n|  ----------------------------------  |\n|  | Username: ____________________ |  |\n|  |                                  |  |\n|  | Password: ____________________ |  |\n|  |                                  |  |\n|  | [ ] Remember Me                  |  |\n|  ----------------------------------  |\n|                                      |\n|  [ Login Button ]                    |\n|                                      |\n|  Forgot Password? | Sign Up          |\n----------------------------------------\n| Fixed Footer (e.g., Contact, Terms) |\n----------------------------------------\n\nExplanation:\n- **Top Navigation Bar:** Includes the logo or name of the application for branding. It remains consistent across pages.\n- **Login Form Section:** Prominently centered for users to enter their username and password.\n  - **Username & Password Fields:** Text boxes for user credentials.\n  - **Remember Me Checkbox:** Allows users to stay logged in.\n- **Login Button:** Primary action for submitting credentials.\n- **Forgot Password/Sign Up:** Links for users who need help logging in or creating an account.\n- **Fixed Footer:** Contains quick links, contact information, or legal disclaimers. It's fixed to provide consistent accessibility."}
