                           |\n| [Home]  [Features]  [Pricing]  [About]  [Contact]       |\n+---------------------------------------------------------+\n|                                                         |\n|              USER LOGIN PAGE                            |\n|                                                         |\n|  +--------------------------------------------+         |\n|  |                                            |         |\n|  |  [ Company Logo or Branding ]              |         |\n|  |                                            |         |\n|  +--------------------------------------------+         |\n|                                                         |\n|                                      +-------------+    |\n|                                      | Sign Up Now |    |\n|                                      +-------------+    |\n|                                                         |\n|  +-------------------------------+                      |\n|  |          Login to Your Account|                      |\n|  +-------------------------------+                      |\n|  |                                                 |    |\n|  | Username/Email: [____________________]          |    |\n|  | Password:     [____________________]          |    |\n|  |                                                 |    |\n|  | [ ] Remember Me  ( ) Forgot Password?           |    |\n|  |                                                 |    |\n|  |   +----------------+                            |    |\n|  |   |   Log In       |                            |    |\n|  |   +----------------+                            |    |\n|  +-------------------------------------------------+    |\n|                                                         |\n|                                                          |\n|                                                         |\n+---------------------------------------------------------+\n| Fixed Footer                                            |\n| © 2023 Company Name | Privacy | Terms | Help         |\n+---------------------------------------------------------+\n```\nThe wireframe above represents the main user login page for an Angular web application:\n\n- **Top Navigation Bar**: Includes common navigation options like Home, Features, Pricing, About, and Contact, providing users with quick access to the rest of the site.\n- **Logo/Branding Area**: A designated space for displaying the company logo or branding, reinforcing brand identity.\n- **Sign Up Now**: A button that redirects users to a registration page, encouraging users to create an account if they do not already have one.\n- **Login to Your Account**: The central form for users to enter their credentials, including fields for Username/Email and Password. It includes options like 'Remember Me' and 'Forgot Password?'.\n- **Login Button**: For users to submit their login information and access their accounts.\n- **Fixed Footer**: Provides additional links and information like privacy policy, terms, and customer support options, consistently accessible from the login page.\n\n"}
