{"level":"error","error":"invalid character 'T' looking for beginning of value","time":1750626657344,"caller":"/Users/amakura/source/repos/aiup-go-gen/internal/agent/assistant.go:235","message":"Failed to parse LLM response as AgentMessage \nContent: To create a new Angular web application with a user login page, I will provide a wireframe that serves as the blueprint for the user login interface. This wireframe outlines the layout and fundamental elements that should be included on the login page.\n\n### Wireframe for User Login Page\n\n```\n+----------------------------------------------------------+\n|                          HEADER                           |\n|-----------------------------------------------------------|\n|                        (App Logo)                         |\n|-----------------------------------------------------------|\n|                       USER LOGIN                          |\n|-----------------------------------------------------------|\n|                                                           |\n|   +-----------------------------------------------+       |\n|   | Email Address                                |       |  \n|   +-----------------------------------------------+       |\n|                                                           |\n|   +-----------------------------------------------+       |\n|   | Password                                      |       |\n|   +-----------------------------------------------+       |\n|                                                           |\n|   [ ] Remember Me                                          |\n|                                                           |\n|   +---------------------+                                  |\n|   |  Login              |  [Forgot Password?]              |\n|   +---------------------+                                  |\n|                                                           |\n|   -- OR --                                                |\n|                                                           |\n|   [Login with Google]  [Login with Facebook]             |\n|                                                           |\n|-----------------------------------------------------------|\n|                         FOOTER                             |\n|-----------------------------------------------------------|\n|                   Terms | Privacy Policy                   |\n+-----------------------------------------------------------+\n```\n\n### Explanation\n\n- **Header**: Contains the app logo or title for brand recognition.\n- **User Login Section**: \n  - **Email Address Field**: For entering the user's email.\n  - **Password Field**: For entering the user's password.\n  - **Remember Me Checkbox**: Option to stay logged in on the current device.\n  - **Login Button**: To submit login credentials.\n  - **Forgot Password Link**: Allows users to reset their password if forgotten.\n- **Social Login Options**: Quick links for logging in with third-party services like Google or Facebook.\n- **Footer**: Contains quick links to the Terms and Privacy Policy.\n\nThis structure ensures that users have clear and easy access to their account login options, along with the ability to reset their password or use alternative login methods. This basic yet comprehensive interface addresses various user needs efficiently.\n\nThe next step is to pass this design over to the Assistant agent to begin the implementation in Angular."}
