  © 2023 Company Name                |  <-- Fixed Footer\n+-----------------------------------------------------+\n```\n\n### Sections and Description:\n\n1. **Top Navigation Bar**:\n   - Displays key navigation points: \"Home\", \"Login\", \"Dashboard\", \"Support\", \"Settings\".\n   - Users can navigate between different sections easily.\n\n2. **Main Content Area**:\n   - Central logo or image representing the application.\n   - **Form to Enter Credentials**: \n     - Includes fields for \"Username\" and \"Password\", each with labeled input boxes.\n     - Actionable buttons such as \"Login\" for submitting the credentials and \"Forgot Password?\" for recovery assistance.\n\n3. **Fixed Footer**:\n   - Contains basic copyright information. \n   - Can include additional quick links or legal disclaimers if necessary.\n\n**Interaction**:\n- Users click on the \"Login\" button after entering their credentials.\n- If password is forgotten, they can click \"Forgot Password?\" to initiate recovery.\n- Navigation bar provides easy access to other parts of the application.\n\nWith this wireframe, we can now proceed to implement the login page in Angular. The next step is to code up this layout. I will delegate this task to the coding agent for development."}
