---------------------------------------------------|\n|                                                            |\n|  [Footer with quick links: Terms of Service, Privacy]      |\n|                                                            |\n+------------------------------------------------------------+\n```\n\n### Explanation:\n\n1. **Header**: Contains a logo and a top navigation bar with links to “Home,” “Login,” “About,” and “Contact.” This ensures that users can navigate to main areas directly from the login page.\n\n2. **Main Content Area**:\n   - **Login Form**: Where users will input their credentials.\n   - **Username & Password Fields**: Clearly labeled input fields for username and password entry.\n   - **Remember Me Checkbox**: Offers users the option to keep their session logged in.\n   - **Login Button**: Prominent call-to-action to process login.\n   - **Forgot Password Link**: Provides assistance with account recovery in case they forget their password.\n\n3. **Signup Prompt**: For new users who need to create an account, linking to the signup page.\n\n4. **Footer**: Contains quick links to essential pages like “Terms of Service” and “Privacy,” ensuring users have access to legal and informational content.\n\nWith this design outline complete, the next step is to implement this login page with actual Angular components, which will be handled by the UI coding agent."}
