{"level":"debug","agent":"ux","time":1750720019130,"caller":"/Users/amakura/source/repos/aiup-go-gen/internal/agent/assistant.go:243","message":"```\nASCII Wireframe for 'Main User Login Page':\n\n[Top Navigation Bar]\n|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n|    Logo    |    Home    |    About    |    Contact Us    |    Support    |    Login    |\n|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n\n[Main Content Area]\n|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n|                                                                                                               |\n|                                        [Login]                                                               |\n|                                                                                                               |\n|                            -------------------------------------------------                                 |\n|                           |                                                   |                                |\n|                           |            Username or Email                      |                                |\n|                           |---------------------------------------------------|                                |\n|                                                                                                               |\n|                            -------------------------------------------------                                 |\n|                           |                                                   |                                |\n|                           |            Password                               |                                |\n|                           |-----------------------