{"level":"debug","agent":"ux","time":1750720570131,"caller":"/Users/amakura/source/repos/aiup-go-gen/internal/agent/assistant.go:264","message":"Main User Login Page Wireframe:\n\n+----------------------------------+\n|          Top Navigation          |\n|----------------------------------|\n| [ App Logo ]      [ Home ] [ Help ]\n|----------------------------------|\n|                                  |\n|           Login to Your          |\n|           Account                |\n|                                  |\n|   +-------------------------+    |\n|   | Email Address           |    |\n|   +-------------------------+    |\n|                                  |\n|   +-------------------------+    |\n|   | Password                |    |\n|   +-------------------------+    |\n|                                  |\n|   [  Login Button  ] [  Forgot? ]|\n|                                  |\n|----------------------------------|\n|            Footer                |\n|  [ About ] [ Privacy ] [ Terms ] |\n+----------------------------------+\n\nExplanation:\n- Top Navigation: Contains the app logo for branding and key navigation links such as 'Home' and 'Help'.\n- Main Content: This section focuses on user login. It features two input fields for 'Email Address' and 'Password'. Below these inputs, a 'Login Button' is prominently placed for submitting the credentials, with a 'Forgot?' link for password recovery.\n- Footer: A fixed footer with essential links like 'About', 'Privacy', and 'Terms', providing additional information at any time.\n\nThis design ensures a minimalist and user-friendly interface, emphasizing ease of access to the login process."}
