{"level":"debug","agent":"ux","time":1750721239930,"caller":"/Users/amakura/source/repos/aiup-go-gen/internal/agent/assistant.go:264","message":"\n\n------------------- User Login Page Wireframe -------------------\n\n+----------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                      Top Navigation Bar                        |\n|----------------------------------------------------------------|\n| [Logo]                    Login Page                           |\n|----------------------------------------------------------------|\n\n                             Main Content Area                     \n\n            +-------------------------------------------+\n            |                                           |\n            |  [ Username: _____________________ ]      |\n            |                                           |\n            |  [ Password: _____________________ ]      |\n            |                                           |\n            |              [ Login Button ]             |\n            |                                           |\n            |        [ Forgot Password? Link ]          |\n            |                                           |\n            +-------------------------------------------+\n\n+----------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                      Fixed Footer Section                      |\n|----------------------------------------------------------------|\n|                  [ Contact Us ]   |   [ Privacy ]              |\n+----------------------------------------------------------------+\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nExplanation:\n- **Top Navigation Bar**: A simple navigation bar at the top of the page with space for a logo and the label ‘Login Page’, providing context and easy navigation.\n- **Main Content Area**: \n  - **Username and Password Fields**: Inputs where users can enter their login credentials.\n  - **Login Button**: A call-to-action button to submit the credentials.\n  - **Forgot Password?**: A link below the login button to assist users who may have forgotten their password.\n- **Fixed Footer Section**: Contains quick links for 'Contact Us' and 'Privacy' to provide support and information to users.\n\nThe layout is user-friendly with clear navigation and focus on the login functionality. Minimalist design ensures ease of use and a straightforward user experience.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------"}
